 Store_test;dir;t;o;n;before;c
⍝ Store works on its own small files in /tmp, so the sample data isn't touched.
 dir←'/tmp/store-test/'
 {}3 ⎕MKDIR dir
 {}{⎕NEXISTS ⍵:⎕NDELETE ⍵ ⋄ 0}¨dir∘,¨'customers.dcf' 'orders.dcf'
 t←(dir,'customers')⎕FCREATE 0
 {}'header'⎕FAPPEND t
 {}('id' 'name' 'city' 'credit_limit' 'joined')⎕FAPPEND t
 {}(1 'Ann' 'London' 4000 '2024-01-01')⎕FAPPEND t
 {}(2 'Zoë' 'Berlin' 5000 '2024-02-02')⎕FAPPEND t
 {}⎕FUNTIE t
 t←(dir,'orders')⎕FCREATE 0
 o←⎕NS'' ⋄ o.(id customer lines)←1001 2(1 3⍴'Widget' 2 4.99)
 {}o ⎕FAPPEND t
 {}⎕FUNTIE t

 Store.Open dir
 2 ExpectEq≢Store.Customers
 'Zoë'ExpectEq(Store.Customer 2).name               ⍝ records come back as namespaces
 5000 ExpectEq(Store.Customer 2).credit_limit
 11 ExpectError'Store.Customer 99'                   ⍝ unknown id → DOMAIN ERROR
 1 ExpectEq≢Store.OrdersFor 2
 0 ExpectEq≢Store.OrdersFor 1

⍝ AddOrder appends; the new order is then visible to readers
 before←≢Store.Orders
 o←⎕NS'' ⋄ o.(id customer lines)←1002 1(1 3⍴'Gizmo' 1 49)
 n←Store.AddOrder o
 2 ExpectEq n                                         ⍝ component 2
 (before+1)ExpectEq≢Store.Orders
 1002 ExpectEq(⊃Store.OrdersFor 1).id
